resources.string:
⚠ No sign of the PS2 after %1$d s. Check:
 • the PS2 IP is in the same network as the phone (e.g. %3$s, mask 255.255.255.0) or uses DHCP;
 • the server address on the PS2 is %2$s;
 • the green/orange LED of the network port lights up on the hub;
 • the loader uses the right protocol (OPL → SMB, NHDDL/Neutrino → UDPFS/UDPBD).
